# App

## Run contract

- The app is built from `Dockerfile` in this directory and the container listens on port {{ run.port }}.
- The API is served under `{{ run.api_prefix }}`. `GET {{ run.health_path }}` answers `{"status": "ok"}` once the app is ready.
{% if has_frontend %}
- The backend also serves the frontend build at `/`.
{% else %}
- The user interface is served by the backend, starting at `/`.
{% endif %}
- Persistent data lives in `{{ run.data_dir }}` (relative to the working directory `/app`).
{% if stack.database == "postgres" %}
- The database is PostgreSQL. Its connection URL is in the environment variable `DATABASE_URL` (`postgresql://user:password@host:port/name`).
{% endif %}

